  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Hardened UDP Transport: Optimized sliding window anti-replay protection and session-aware endpoint pinning.\n- Admission Security Guards: Hardened ConnectionGuard and DatagramGuard for flood protection, connection limits, and IP blacklists.\n- Centralized Connection Hub: Thread-safe, sharded ConnectionHub with async broadcast and connection eviction.\n- Coordinated Transport Listeners: Unified TCP, UDP, and WebSocket abstract listener loops with optimized concurrent performance.",
